    "question": "<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">Which of the following relation is not correct?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #3498DB;\">[UPPSC RO/ARO (Pre)]</span></p>",
