/span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">MB)</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">के बराबर होता है</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">न कि </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">1024 </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">किलोबाइट्स के। सही पदानुक्रम है: </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">1 KB = 1024 Bytes, 1 MB = 1024 KB, 1 GB = 1024 MB</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">। इसलिए दिया गया संबंध गलत है।</span></p>"
