  {
    "question": "<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">In a memory of what size will the last memory location be FFFF?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #3498DB;\">[BPSC TRE 2.0 Exam-2023 (11-12)]</span></p>",
